    "created_at": "2026-10-11T18:12:23Z",
    "text": "getting a phone number usually means export, enrich somewhere else, import again.\n\nhere's the phone playbook in https://t.co/GsoFzpQIZq, step by step, without leaving the Leads page:\n\nstep 1: pick the leads worth calling\n- start from your best ICP fits\n- the Phone column shows \"Reveal · 5 credits\" on each lead\n\nstep 2: one lead or a batch\n- reveal a single number from its row\n- or select several leads and click Find phones\n\nstep 3: check the cost before it runs\n- the dialog tells you upfront: 5 credits per number found, nothing when none is\n- and how many credits you have left\n\nstep 4: let it run in the background\n- https://t.co/GsoFzpQIZq reveals the numbers it already holds and runs its enrichment waterfall for the rest\n- numbers appear in their rows as they're found\n\nstep 5: automate it for new leads\n- turn on Auto-enrich: it finds phones, or email and phone, for new leads above an ICP-fit threshold you choose\n- it's off by default and only applies to new leads sourced while it's on\n\none setup note: you only pay when a number comes back. no result, no charge.\n\nbookmark this if you want to set it up later.",
